hadiths[54]{hadithnumber,text}:
"794","[AI-translation] Alqama (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Mina mein Abdullah (bin Mas'ud) ke saath chal raha tha ke unhein Usman (raziyallahu anhuma) milay to wo un ke saath khaday ho kar baat kartay rahay. To Usman ne un se kaha: Ae Abu Abdur Rahman! Kya main tumhara nikah kisi jawan londi se na kar dun, shayad wo tumhein tumharay guzray zamanay ki baaz baat yaad dilaye? Unhon ne kaha: To Abdullah ne kaha: Agar tum ne ye kaha hai to beshak Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ham se farmaya tha: Ae jawanon ki jamaat! Tum mein se jo shaadi ki taqat rakhta ho wo shaadi karay, beshak ye nigaah ko zyada jhukanay wali aur sharmgah ki zyada hifazat karnay wali hai, aur jo taqat na rakhta ho to us par rozah lazim hai, beshak wo us ke liye (khwahish) tornay wala hai. (Muslim: 4/128)"
"795","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se kuch afraad ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj se Aap ke poshida amal ke baaray mein poocha. To un mein se baaz ne kaha: Main auraton se shaadi nahi karun ga, aur baaz ne kaha: Main gosht nahi khaun ga, aur baaz ne kaha: Main bistar par nahi soun ga. To Aap ne Allah ki hamd ki aur Us ki sana bayan ki, phir farmaya: Logon ka kya haal hai ke unhon ne aisa aisa kaha? Lekin main namaz padhta hun aur sota hun, rozah rakhta hun aur iftar karta hun, aur auraton se shaadi karta hun. To jo meri sunnat se munh moray wo mujh se nahi. (Muslim: 4/129)"
"796","[AI-translation] Sa'd bin Abu Waqqas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Usman bin Maz'un ko be-shaadi rehnay (tabattul) se rok diya, aur agar Aap usay ijazat detay to ham khassi ho jatay. (Muslim: 4/129). Baab: Duniya ka behtareen samaan naik aurat hai."
"797","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Duniya samaan hai, aur duniya ka behtareen samaan naik aurat hai. (Muslim: 4/178). Baab: Deendaar (aurat) se nikah ke baaray mein."
"798","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Aurat se chaar (cheezon) ki wajah se nikah kiya jata hai: Us ke maal ki wajah se, us ke hasab ki wajah se, us ke husn ki wajah se aur us ke deen ki wajah se. To deendaar ko hasil karo, tumharay haath khaak aalood hon. (Muslim: 4/175)"
"799","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke (mere walid) Abdullah faut ho gaye aur no betiyan, ya kaha ke saat betiyan chhorin. To main ne aik bewah aurat se shaadi ki. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Jabir! Tum ne shaadi ki? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Kunwari se ya bewah se? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Balke bewah se, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne farmaya: Kisi kunwari larki se kyun na ki jis se tum kheltay aur wo tum se khelti, ya farmaya ke tum usay hansatay aur wo tumhein hansati? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Aap se kaha: Beshak Abdullah faut ho gaye aur no ya saat betiyan chhorin, aur main ne napasand kiya ke main un ke paas un jaisi larki laun. To main ne pasand kiya ke aisi aurat laun jo un ki dekh bhaal karay aur un ki islah karay. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhein barkat de, ya mujh se khair (ki dua) farmayi. (Muslim: 4/176). Baab: Apne bhai ke paigham par paigham na bhejay."
"800","[AI-translation] Abdur Rahman bin Shamasa se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se mimbar par kehtay hue suna: Beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Momin momin ka bhai hai, to momin ke liye halal nahi ke wo apne bhai ki baich par baich karay aur na apne bhai ke paigham par paigham bhejay yahan tak ke wo chhor de. (Muslim: 4/139). Baab: Shaadi ka irada rakhnay walay ka aurat ko dekhna. (Khitba kha ke zair ke saath hai; tark karnay se murad khareednay walay ka apna sauda aur paigham bhejnay walay ka apna paigham chhorna hai.)"
"801","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Beshak main ne Ansaar ki aik aurat se shaadi ki hai. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Kya tum ne usay dekha? Beshak Ansaar ki aankhon mein kuch (aib) hai. Us ne kaha: Main ne usay dekha hai. Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne us se kitnay (mahr) par shaadi ki? Us ne kaha: Chaar ooqiya par. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us se farmaya: Chaar ooqiya par, goya tum is pahar ke pehlu se chandi kaat-tay ho. Hamaray paas wo nahi jo ham tumhein dein, lekin shayad ham tumhein kisi lashkar mein bhejein jis se tum (maal) hasil karo. Unhon ne kaha: To Aap ne Banu Abs ki taraf aik lashkar bheja aur us mard ko un mein bheja. (Muslim: 4/142-143). Baab: Nikah mein kunwari aur bewah se ijazat lena. (Urd ain ke pesh ke saath pehlu aur taraf hai.)"
"802","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bewah (pehle shaadi shuda) aurat ka nikah us ki ijazat ke baghair na kiya jaye, aur kunwari ka nikah us ki ijazat ke baghair na kiya jaye. Logon ne poocha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Kunwari ki ijazat kaisay li jaye gi? Aap ne farmaya: Us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai. (Muslim). (Ayyim wo aurat hai jis ka shohar na ho, choti ho ya bari, kunwari ho ya pehle shaadi shuda, ye lughat mein hai; yahan kunwari ke muqabil honay ki wajah se murad pehle shaadi shuda hai, jisay Ibn Abbas ki riwayat mein ayyim ki jagah sayyib ka lafz aana mazboot karta hai.)"
"803","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Bewah apne nafs ki apne wali se zyada haqdar hai, aur kunwari se us ke nafs ke baaray mein ijazat li jaye, aur us ki ijazat us ki khamoshi hai. (Muslim: 4/141). Baab: Nikah mein shartein. (Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai ke sayyib apne wali se zyada haq rakhti hai.)"
"804","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Amir (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Sab se zyada haq wali shart jisay poora kiya jaye wo hai jis ke zariye tum ne sharmgahein halal keen. (Muslim: 4/140). Baab: Choti (umar ki larki) ka nikah."
"805","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se nikah kiya jab main chhe saal ki thi aur mujh se صحبت (rukhsati) ki jab main no saal ki thi. Unhon ne kaha: Phir ham Madina aaye to main aik maheena bukhar mein mubtala rahi, phir mere baal kandhon tak jama hue. Phir mere paas Umm Ruman aayi jabke main jhoolay par thi aur mere saath meri saheliyan thin. To unhon ne mujhe pukara to main un ke paas aayi aur mujhe maloom na tha ke wo mujh se kya chahti hain. To unhon ne mera haath pakra aur mujhe darwazay par khada kiya. To main ne kaha: Hah hah, yahan tak ke meri saans phool gayi. Phir unhon ne mujhe aik ghar mein dakhil kiya to wahan Ansaar ki aurtein thin. To unhon ne kaha: Khair o barkat par aur behtareen naseeb par. To unhon ne mujhe un ke hawalay kar diya. To unhon ne mera sar dhoya aur mujhe sanwara. Phir mujhe khabar na hui siwae is ke ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) chasht ke waqt (tashreef laye), to unhon ne mujhe Aap ke hawalay kar diya. (Muslim: 4/141-142). Baab: Londi ko azaad kar ke us se nikah karna. (Bukhar ke dard se murad aik maheena bukhar mein mubtala rehna hai; jumaima jamma ki tasgheer hai, kandhon tak utarnay walay baal; taair se murad naseeb hai.)"
"806","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar par ghazwa kiya. Unhon ne kaha: To ham ne us ke paas subah ki namaz andheray mein padhi. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) sawaar hue aur Abu Talha (raziyallahu anhu) bhi sawaar hue, aur main Abu Talha ke peechay sawaar tha. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni sawari par Khaibar mein dakhil hue jabke mera ghutna Nabi ke ghutnay se lagta tha, is bheer ki wajah se jo daud mein hui, kyunke Nabi ki raan se kapra hat gaya tha aur main Aap ki raan ki safedi dekh raha tha. Jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) basti mein dakhil hue to farmaya: Allahu Akbar! Khaibar tabah hui, yani Allah sab se bara hai aur Khaibar barbaad hai. Aur farmaya: Jab ham kisi qaum ke sehan mein utrein to darae hue logon ki subah buri hai. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne ye teen baar farmaya. Anas ne kaha ke log apne kaam mein lagay hue thay. Jab unhon ne lashkar dekha aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki awaz suni to kaha: Allah ki qasam! Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) lashkar sameet aaye hain. Anas (raziyallahu anhu) kehtay hain ke ham ne Khaibar ko taqat se fatah kiya aur qaidi aik jagah jama kiye gaye. Phir Dihya Kalbi (raziyallahu anhu) aaye aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Qaidiyon mein se aik londi mujhe de dijiye. Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jao, jo londi chaho le lo. Unhon ne Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ko muntakhab kiya. Phir aik mard Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Aap ne Dihya ko Safiyya bint Huyay de di hai jo Banu Quraiza aur Banu Nazeer ke sardar ki beti hai, wo sirf Aap ke layak hai. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dihya aur us londi ko bulao. To Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ko laya gaya. Jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ko dekha to (Dihya se) farmaya: Safiyya ke siwa koi aur londi le lo. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ko azaad kiya aur us se nikah kiya. Sabit ne Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se poocha: Ae Abu Hamza! Aap ne un ka mahr kitna muqarrar kiya? Anas (raziyallahu anhu) ne kaha: Un ka mahr un ki zaat thi, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne unhein azaad kiya aur un se nikah kiya. Nabi safar hi mein thay ke Umm Sulaim (raziyallahu anha) ne Safiyya (raziyallahu anha) ko dulhan banaya aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas layin. Subah Nabi dulha thay. Phir Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jis ke paas khana ho wo laye. Aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne dastar khwan bichaya, to koi paneer laya, koi khajoor laya aur koi ghee laya. To sahaba ne in sab ko milaya aur hais banaya aur khaya. Yehi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka waleema tha. (Muslim). (Sab se murad daud mein honay wali bheer hai; khamees murattab lashkar hai; sabit se murad Sabit Bunani hain jo Anas se kasrat se riwayat karnay walon mein se hain; aroos mard aur aurat donon ko kehtay hain.)"
"807","[AI-translation] Abu Musa Ash'ari (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us shakhs ke baaray mein farmaya jo apni londi ko azaad karay phir us se nikah karay: Us ke liye do ajar hain. (Muslim: 4/146). Baab: Shighar ka nikah."
"808","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shighar se mana farmaya, aur shighar ye hai ke aadmi apni beti ka nikah is shart par karay ke wo us ki beti ka nikah us se karay aur un donon ke darmiyan mahr na ho. (Muslim: 4/139). Baab: Mut'a ke nikah ke baaray mein."
"809","[AI-translation] Qais se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Abdullah bin Mas'ud (raziyallahu anhu) ko kehtay hue suna: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath ghazwa kartay thay aur hamaray saath aurtein na hotin thin. To ham ne kaha: Kya ham apne aap ko khassi na kara lein? To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein is se mana farmaya. Phir hamein kapray ke badlay aurat se muddat muqarrar nikah, yani mut'a, ki ijazat di. Phir Abdullah (raziyallahu anhu) ne ye aayat padhi: Ae iman walon! Un pakeeza cheezon ko haraam na karo jo Allah ne tumharay liye halal keen aur had se na badho. Beshak Allah had se badhnay walon ko pasand nahi karta. (Muslim)."
"810","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam), Abu Bakr ke zamanay mein khajoor aur aatay ki aik mutthi ke badlay (mut'a ka) faida uthatay thay (muddat muqarrar nikah kartay thay), yahan tak ke Umar (raziyallahu anhu) ne Amr bin Hurais ke waqiye mein is se mana farmaya. (Muslim: 4/131). Baab: Mut'a ke nikah ka mansookh hona aur us ka haraam hona."
"811","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abu Talib (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Khaibar ke din auraton se mut'a se mana farmaya aur paaltu gadon ke gosht (khanay) se. (Muslim: 4/134)"
"812","[AI-translation] Rabi bin Sabra se, un ke walid se riwayat hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath Fatah Makka par ghazwa mein thay. Unhon ne kaha: To ham wahan pandra din, teen raat din ke darmiyan, thehray. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne hamein auraton se mut'a ki ijazat di. To main aur meri qaum ka aik aadmi niklay, mujhe us par husn mein fazilat thi jabke wo badsoorat honay ke qareeb tha, ham mein se har aik ke paas aik chadar thi. Meri chadar purani thi jabke mere chachazaad ki chadar nai umdah thi. Yahan tak ke jab ham Makka ke neechay ya upar thay to hamein aik larki mili jo lambi gardan wali kunwari oontni jaisi thi. To ham ne us se kaha: Kya tumhein pasand hai ke ham mein se koi tum se (mut'a ka) faida uthaye? Us ne kaha: Tum donon kya do ge? To ham mein se har aik ne apni chadar bichha di. To wo donon mardon ko dekhnay lagi aur mera saathi usay us ke pehlu ki taraf dekhtay hue dekhta raha. To us ne kaha: Beshak is ki chadar purani hai jabke meri chadar nai umdah hai. To wo kehti rahi: Is ki chadar mein koi haraj nahi, teen baar ya do baar. Phir main ne us se (mut'a ka) faida uthaya. Phir main (wahan se) na nikla yahan tak ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay haraam kar diya. (Muslim: 4/132). (Ataa lambi gardan wali, seedhi qamat wali hai; ye Fatah Makka ke ghazway mein tha jo sahih hai, Hajjat-ul-Wida wali Abu Dawood ki riwayat shaaz hai.)"
"813","[AI-translation] Sabra Juhani (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath thay to Aap ne farmaya: Ae logon! Beshak main ne tumhein auraton se (mut'a ka) faida uthanay ki ijazat di thi, aur beshak Allah ne usay qayamat ke din tak haraam kar diya hai. To jis ke paas un mein se koi ho wo usay chhor de aur jo tum ne unhein diya hai us mein se kuch na lo. (Muslim: 4/132). (Muslim ke paas sabeelah hai; ye hadees Muslim ke paas Sabra Juhani se mukhtalif sanadon se hai, qayamat tak wali riwayat mein Abdul Aziz bin Umar hain jo sadooq hain magar ghalti kartay hain, lekin un ki mutabiat un ke walid Umar bin Abdul Aziz ne ki hai.)"
"814","[AI-translation] Nubaih bin Wahb se riwayat hai ke Umar bin Ubaidullah ne Talha bin Umar ka nikah Shaiba bin Jubair ki beti se karnay ka irada kiya. To us ne Aban bin Usman ko bheja ke wo us mein haazir hon jabke wo hajj ke ameer thay. To Aban ne kaha: Main ne Usman bin Affan (raziyallahu anhu) ko kehtay hue suna: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Ehram wala na nikah karay, na us ka nikah kiya jaye aur na paigham bhejay. (Muslim: 4/136)"
"815","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Maimuna se nikah kiya jabke Aap ehram walay thay. (Muslim: 4/137). (Ye lafz asal se gir gaya tha, Muslim se poora kiya gaya.)"
"816","[AI-translation] Yazid bin Asamm (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Mujhe Maimuna bint Haris (raziyallahu anha) ne bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne un se nikah kiya jabke Aap halal (ghair ehram walay) thay. Unhon ne kaha: Aur wo meri khala thin aur Ibn Abbas ki khala thin. (Muslim: 4/137-138). Baab: Aurat aur us ki phuphi ya us ki khala ko jama karnay ki hurmat."
"817","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne chaar auraton ko jama karnay se mana farmaya: Aurat aur us ki phuphi, aur aurat aur us ki khala. (Muslim: 4/135). Baab: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka apni azwaaj ko mahr."
"818","[AI-translation] Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Aisha se poocha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka mahr kitna tha? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ka apni azwaaj ko mahr barah ooqiya aur nash tha. Unhon ne kaha: Kya tum jantay ho nash kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Nahi. Unhon ne kaha: Aadha ooqiya, to ye paanch sau dirham hain. To ye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ka apni azwaaj ko mahr tha. (Muslim: 4/144). Baab: Sonay ki guthli ke wazan par nikah."
"819","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Abdur Rahman bin Auf (raziyallahu anhu) par zardi ka nishan dekha. Aap ne farmaya: Ye kya hai? Us ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main ne sonay ki guthli ke wazan par aik aurat se shaadi ki hai. Aap ne farmaya: Allah tumhein barkat de, waleema karo chahe aik bakri ho. (Muslim: 4/144)"
"820","[AI-translation] Sahl bin Sa'd Sa'idi (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik aurat Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas aayi aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main apna nafs Aap ko hiba karnay aayi hun. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne us ki taraf dekha aur nazar upar ki aur neechay ki, phir Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna sar jhuka diya. Phir jab aurat ne dekha ke Aap ne us ke baaray mein kuch faisla nahi farmaya to wo baith gayi. Phir Aap ke sahaba mein se aik mard khada hua aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Agar Aap ko us ki haajat na ho to mujh se us ka nikah kar dijiye. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tumharay paas kuch hai? To us ne kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, Ae Allah ke Rasool! To Aap ne farmaya: Apne ghar walon ke paas jao aur dekho kya tum kuch patay ho. To wo gaya phir wapas aaya aur kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, main ne kuch nahi paya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Dekho chahe lohay ki angoothi ho. To wo gaya phir wapas aaya aur kaha: Nahi, Allah ki qasam, Ae Allah ke Rasool, lohay ki angoothi bhi nahi, lekin ye meri tehband hai. Sahl ne kaha: Us ke paas chadar na thi, to us ka aadha us (aurat) ke liye hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Tum apni tehband ka kya karo ge? Agar tum ne usay pehna to us mein se us par kuch na hoga, aur agar us ne usay pehna to us mein se tum par kuch na hoga. To wo mard baith gaya yahan tak ke jab us ka baithna lamba ho gaya to wo khada hua. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne usay peeth phirtay hue dekha to Aap ne usay bulaya. Phir jab wo aaya to Aap ne farmaya: Tumharay paas Quran mein se kya hai? Us ne kaha: Mere paas falan falan surat hai, us ne ginin. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum unhein zubani padhtay ho? Us ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Jao, main ne usay tumharay nikah mein de diya us Quran ke badlay jo tumharay paas hai. (Muslim: 4/143). Baab: Allah Taala ke qaul ke baaray mein: Tum jinhein chaho muakkhar karo, aayat."
"821","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main un auraton par ghairat karti thi jinhon ne apne nafs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko hiba kiye thay aur kehti thi: Kya aurat apna nafs hiba karti hai? Phir jab Allah Taala ne naazil farmaya: Tum un mein se jisay chaho muakkhar karo aur jisay chaho apne paas rakho aur jisay tum ne alag kiya us mein se jisay chaho (wapas bula lo). Unhon ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Main tumharay Rab ko nahi dekhti magar wo tumhari khwahish mein jaldi karta hai. (Muslim: 4/174). Baab: Shawwal mein shaadi karna. (Murad tumhari raza hai, yani tum par aasani karta hai.)"
"822","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se Shawwal mein nikah kiya aur mujh se Shawwal mein صحبت (rukhsati) ki. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki kin azwaaj mein se kaun mujh se zyada Aap ke nazdeek khush naseeb thi? Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aisha pasand karti thin ke apni (rishtadar) auraton ko Shawwal mein rukhsat karein. (Muslim: 4/142). Baab: Nikah mein waleema."
"823","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni azwaaj mein se kisi aurat par us waleemay se zyada waleema nahi kiya jo Ummul Momineen Zainab (raziyallahu anha) par kiya. To Sabit Bunani ne poocha: Aap ne waleemay mein kya khilaya? Unhon ne kaha: Aap ne gosht roti khilayi yahan tak ke log sair ho kar kha gaye aur khana bach gaya. Aik riwayat ke izafay mein hai ke Aap ne bakri ka waleema kiya. (Muslim)."
"824","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne shaadi ki aur apne ghar walon se صحبت (rukhsati) ki. Unhon ne kaha: To meri walida Umm Sulaim ne hais banaya aur usay taur (bartan) mein rakha. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Anas! Ye Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le jao aur kaho: Meri walida ne Aap ki taraf ye bheja hai aur wo Aap ko salam kehti hain aur kehti hain: Beshak ye Aap ke liye hamari taraf se thora hai, Ae Allah ke Rasool! Unhon ne kaha: To main usay Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas le gaya aur kaha: Beshak meri walida Aap ko salam kehti hain aur kehti hain: Beshak ye Aap ke liye hamari taraf se thora hai, Ae Allah ke Rasool! To Aap ne farmaya: Usay rakh do. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Jao aur mere liye falan, falan aur falan ko bulao aur jisay tum pao. Aur Aap ne mardon ke naam liye. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne jin ke naam liye aur jinhein main paya unhein bulaya. Unhon ne kaha: Main ne Anas se kaha: Wo tadad mein kitnay thay? Unhon ne kaha: Taqreeban teen sau. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Anas! Taur lao. Unhon ne kaha: To wo dakhil hue yahan tak ke suffa aur hujra bhar gaya. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Das das halqa bana lo aur har insan apne saamnay se khaye. Unhon ne kaha: To unhon ne khaya yahan tak ke sair ho gaye. Unhon ne kaha: Phir aik giroh nikla aur aik giroh dakhil hua yahan tak ke sab ne kha liya. To Aap ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Anas! Uthao. Unhon ne kaha: To main ne uthaya. To mujhe maloom nahi ke jab main ne rakha tha tab zyada tha ya jab main ne uthaya. Unhon ne kaha: Aur un mein se chand giroh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke ghar mein baatein kartay hue baithay rahay jabke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) baithay thay aur Aap ki zauja apna chehra deewar ki taraf kiye hue thin. To wo Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) par bhaari ho gaye. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay aur apni azwaaj ko salam kiya, phir wapas aaye. Phir jab unhon ne dekha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) wapas aaye hain to unhon ne samjha ke wo Aap par bhaari ho gaye hain. Unhon ne kaha: To wo darwazay ki taraf dauday aur sab nikal gaye. Aur Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) aaye yahan tak ke parda gira diya aur dakhil hue jabke main hujray mein baitha hua tha. To Aap thori dair ke siwa na thehray yahan tak ke mere paas niklay aur ye aayat naazil hui. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay aur unhein logon ko padh kar sunaya: Ae iman walon! Nabi ke gharon mein dakhil na ho siwae is ke ke tumhein khanay ki ijazat di jaye, us ke paknay ka intezar kiye baghair, lekin jab tumhein bulaya jaye to dakhil ho, phir jab tum kha lo to muntashir ho jao aur baaton mein dil laganay walay na bano. Beshak ye Nabi ko takleef deta tha, aayat ke aakhir tak. Jad ne kaha: Anas ne kaha: Main logon mein in aayaat se sab se nai mulaqat wala hun, aur Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki azwaaj se parda karaya gaya. (Muslim: 4/150-151). Baab: Nikah mein dawat qabool karnay ke baaray mein. (Jad se murad Jad Abu Usman hain jo Anas se is hadees ke rawi hain.)"
"825","[AI-translation] Nafi se, Ibn Umar (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke wo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se kehtay thay: Jab tum mein se koi apne bhai ko bulaye to wo qabool karay, shaadi ho ya us jaisi. (Muslim: 4/152)"
"826","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab tum mein se kisi ko bulaya jaye to wo qabool karay. Phir agar wo rozaydar ho to dua karay aur agar ghair rozaydar ho to khaye. (Muslim: 4/153). (Falyusalli se murad khanay walon ke liye khair o barkat ki dua hai.)"
"827","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Badtareen khana waleemay ka khana hai, us se rokay jatay hain jo us ke paas aatay hain aur us mein bulaye jatay hain jo usay napasand kartay hain. Aur jo dawat qabool na karay us ne Allah aur Us ke Rasool ki nafarmani ki. (Muslim: 4/154). Baab: Sohbat ke waqt kya kahay."
"828","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar un mein se koi jab apne ghar walon ke paas janay ka irada karay to kahay: Allah ke naam se, Ae Allah! Hamein shaitaan se door rakh aur shaitaan ko us se door rakh jo Tune hamein diya. Beshak agar un donon ke darmiyan us mein bachay ka faisla ho jaye to usay shaitaan kabhi nuqsan na pahunchaye ga. (Muslim: 4/155). Baab: Allah Taala ke qaul ke baaray mein: Tumhari aurtein tumhari khaiti hain."
"829","[AI-translation] Ibn Munkadir se, Jabir (raziyallahu anhu) se sama ke sath riwayat hai, wo kehtay thay: Yahud kehtay thay ke jab aadmi apni aurat ke paas us ki pichli taraf se us ki agli taraf mein aaye to bacha bhenga hota hai. To naazil hui: Tumhari aurtein tumhari khaiti hain, to apni khaiti mein jaisay chaho aao. (Muslim: 4/156). Baab: Us aurat ke baaray mein jo apne shohar ke bistar se inkar karay."
"830","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jab mard apni aurat ko apne bistar par bulaye aur wo na aaye aur wo us par ghussa hotay hue raat guzaray to farishtay us par subah tak lanat kartay hain. (Muslim: 4/157). Baab: Aurat ka raaz phailanay ke baaray mein."
"831","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek martabay mein badtareen logon mein se wo mard hai jo apni aurat se milta hai aur wo us se milti hai, phir wo us ka raaz phailata hai. (Muslim: 4/157). Baab: Banday par Allah ka amal chupana aur us ka apne aap ko zaahir karna. (Rijal mein Umar bin Hamza Umari hain jinhein Ibn Main aur Nasai ne zaeef kaha; Muslim ke paas doosray lafz se riwayat hai ke qayamat ke din Allah ke nazdeek amanat mein bara aadmi wo hai.)"
"832","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ko farmatay hue suna: Meri poori ummat bakhshi hui hai siwae zaahir karnay walon ke. Aur zaahir karna ye hai ke aadmi raat ko (bura) amal karay aur subah ho jabke Allah ne us (buray amal) ko chupaya ho, lekin wo khud kahay: Ae falan! Kal raat main ne aisa aisa (bura) amal kiya, halanke us ne raat ko bura amal kiya tha aur Allah ne usay chupaya tha. Raat ko Rab chupata hai aur subah ye (aadmi) Allah ka parda hatata hai. (Muslim)."
"833","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas azal ka zikr hua. To Aap ne farmaya: Wo tumhein kya hai? Unhon ne kaha: Aadmi ki biwi hoti hai jo doodh pilati hai, to wo us se milta hai aur napasand karta hai ke wo us se hamila ho, aur aadmi ki londi hoti hai, to wo us se milta hai aur napasand karta hai ke wo us se hamila ho. Unhon ne kaha: To tum par (lazim) nahi ke tum aisa na karo, beshak wo taqdeer hai. Ibn Aun ne kaha: To main ne usay Hasan se bayan kiya to unhon ne kaha: Allah ki qasam! Goya ye rok hai. (Muslim: 4/159). (Wati se murad sohbat hai jabke biwi doodh pilati ho; Muslim ki aik riwayat mein hai ke har paida honay wali jaan ko Allah hi paida karnay wala hai; donon lafzon se azal ki karahat samjhi jati hai, hurmat ya mutlaq ibahat nahi.)"
"834","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Aik mard ne Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se sawal kiya aur kaha: Beshak mere paas meri aik londi hai aur main us se azal karta hun. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Beshak ye us cheez ko nahi rokay ga jo Allah ne chahi hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir wo mard aaya aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak wo londi jis ka main ne Aap se zikr kiya tha hamila ho gayi hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main Allah ka banda aur Us ka Rasool hun. (Muslim: 4/160). Baab: Gheela ke baaray mein."
"835","[AI-translation] Judama bint Wahb Asadiya, Ukasha ki behan (raziyallahu anhuma), se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas logon mein haazir thi jabke Aap farma rahay thay: Beshak main ne gheela se manay ka irada kiya. Phir main ne Room aur Faris ko dekha ke wo apni auladon ko gheela karatay hain aur un ki auladon ko is se kuch nuqsan nahi hota. Phir unhon ne Aap se azal ke baaray mein poocha. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Wo poshida zinda dargor karna hai. (Muslim: 4/161). Baab: Qaidi hamila auraton se sohbat. (Gheela ye hai ke aadmi apni doodh pilati biwi se sohbat karay; manay ke iraday ki wajah aulad ke nuqsan ka khauf tha.)"
"836","[AI-translation] Abud Darda (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap khaimay ke darwazay par qareeb-ul-waza (waza ke qareeb) hamila aurat ke paas se guzray. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Shayad us ka saathi us se milna chahta hai? Logon ne kaha: Haan. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main ne usay aisi lanat se lanat karnay ka irada kiya jo us ke saath qabr tak rahay. Wo us larkay ka waris kaisay ho sakta hai jabke wo us ke liye halal nahi? Aur wo us larkay ko ghulam kaisay bana sakta hai jabke wo us ke liye halal nahi? (Muslim). (Mujih se murad wo hamila hai jis ki wiladat qareeb hai.)"
"837","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id Khudri (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne Hunain ke din Autas ki taraf lashkar bheja. To wo dushman se milay aur un se laray aur un par ghalib aaye. To unhein un ki qaidiyan haasil huin. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba mein se baaz log un se milnay se is wajah se jhijhkay ke un ke mushrik shohar thay. To Allah Taala ne is baaray mein naazil farmaya: Aur auraton mein se shohar waliyan, siwae un ke jin ke tumharay daaein haath maalik hue, yani wo tumharay liye halal hain jab un ki iddat guzar jaye. (Muslim: 4/170). Baab: Biwiyon ke darmiyan bari muqarrar karnay ke baaray mein. (Muhsanat se murad yahan shohar waliyan hain, yani wo apne shoharon ke siwa ghairon par haraam hain siwae un ke jinhein tum ne qaidi bana kar haasil kiya; iddat se murad istibra hai.)"
"838","[AI-translation] Anas (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi ki no biwiyan thin. To jab Aap un ke darmiyan bari muqarrar kartay to pehli aurat tak no din ke baghair nahi pahunchay thay, aur wo har raat us ke ghar jama hotin jis ke paas Aap aanay walay hotay. To Aap Aisha ke ghar mein thay ke Zainab aayin to Aap ne un ki taraf apna haath badhaya. To unhon ne kaha: Ye Zainab hain. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apna haath rok liya. To donon aik doosray se kehnay lageen yahan tak ke awazein buland ho gayeen, aur namaz qaim ho gayi. To Abu Bakr (raziyallahu anhu) us par se guzray aur un donon ki awazein sunin. To unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Namaz ke liye nikliye aur un ke munhon mein mitti daliye. To Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) niklay. To Aisha ne kaha: Ab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) apni namaz poori karein ge to Abu Bakr aayein ge aur mujh se aisa aur aisa karein ge. Phir jab Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apni namaz poori ki to Abu Bakr un ke paas aaye aur un se sakht baat kahi aur kaha: Kya tum aisa karti ho?! (Muslim: 4/173). Baab: Kunwari aur bewah ke paas theharnay ke baaray mein. (Zainab ki taraf, Aap ne samjha ke wo Aisha hain kyunke raat thi aur gharon mein chiragh na thay; istakhabata se murad awazein buland karna hai.)"
"839","[AI-translation] Umm Salama (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne jab Umm Salama se nikah kiya to un ke paas teen din thehray aur farmaya: Beshak tum par tumharay ghar walon ki wajah se zillat nahi hai. Agar tum chaho to main tumharay liye saat (din) muqarrar karun, aur agar main tumharay liye saat muqarrar karun to apni (baaqi) biwiyon ke liye saat muqarrar karun ga. (Muslim: 4/173)"
"840","[AI-translation] Anas bin Malik (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Jab wo kunwari se bewah par shaadi karay to us ke paas saat din thehray, aur jab wo bewah se kunwari par shaadi karay to us ke paas teen din thehray. Khalid ne kaha: Agar main kahun ke us ne usay Nabi se marfu bayan kiya to sach kahun ga, lekin us ne kaha: Sunnat isi tarah hai. (Muslim: 4/173). Baab: Aurat ka apni bari doosri ko hiba karna."
"841","[AI-translation] Aisha (raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Main ne Sauda bint Zama se zyada pasand nahi dekha ke main us ki khaal mein hun, un auraton mein se jin mein sakhti hai. Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab wo buri ho gayeen to unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se apna din Aisha ko de diya. Unhon ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Main ne Aap se apna din Aisha ko de diya hai. To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Aisha ke liye do din taqseem kartay thay: Un ka din aur Sauda ka din. (Muslim: 4/174). Baab: Baaz biwiyon ke liye bari chhorna. (Mislakh meem ke zair ke saath khaal hai, yani main wohi ban jaun.)"
"842","[AI-translation] Ata se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Ibn Abbas (raziyallahu anhuma) ke saath Sarif mein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja Maimuna ke janazay mein haazir thay. To Ibn Abbas ne kaha: Ye Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki zauja hain. To jab tum un ka janaza uthao to usay na hilao aur na jhinjhoro aur narmi karo, beshak Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas no (biwiyan) thin, Aap aath ke liye bari muqarrar kartay thay aur aik ke liye nahi kartay thay. Ata ne kaha: Wo jis ke liye bari muqarrar nahi kartay thay wo Safiyya bint Huyay bin Akhtab thin. (Muslim: 4/175). Baab: Jo aurat dekhay to apne ghar walon ke paas aaye taake apne nafs ki (khwahish) door karay. (Ulama ne kaha: Ye wahm hai, sahih wohi hai jo pichli hadees mein hai ke Sauda thin.)"
"843","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne aik aurat dekhi to apni zauja Zainab ke paas aaye jabke wo apni khaal mal rahi thin jo abhi dabaghat mein daali gayi thi. To Aap ne apni haajat poori ki, phir apne sahaba ke paas niklay aur farmaya: Beshak aurat shaitaan ki soorat mein aati hai aur shaitaan ki soorat mein jaati hai. To jab tum mein se koi aurat ko dekhay to apne ghar walon ke paas aaye, beshak ye us ke nafs mein jo hai usay door karay ga. (Muslim: 4/130). Baab: Auraton se narmi aur un ke baaray mein wasiyyat ke baaray mein. (Ma's se murad malna hai; mania sagheera ke wazan par wo khaal hai jo pehle dabaghat mein daali jaye.)"
"844","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Jo Allah aur aakhirat ke din par iman rakhta hai, us par lazim hai ke jab koi muamla paish aaye to achi baat kahay ya khamosh rahay. Aur auraton se acha bartao karo, beshak wo pasli se paida ki gayeen hain aur pasli ka sab se tedha hissa us ka upar wala hissa hai. Agar tum usay seedha karnay ki koshish karo ge to usay tor do ge, aur agar usay jaisa hai waisa chhor do ge to wo tedhi rahay gi. Aur auraton se acha bartao karo. (Muslim)."
"845","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Koi momin mard momin aurat se bughz na rakhay, agar us ki aik aadat napasand karay to doosri se raazi ho jaye, ya Aap ne us ke siwa (koi lafz) farmaya. (Muslim: 4/178). Baab: Agar Hawwa na hotin to koi aurat apne shohar se khayanat na karti. (Fark se murad aisa bughz hai jo chhor nay tak pahunchaye.)"
"846","[AI-translation] Abu Huraira (raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Agar Bani Israil na hotay to khana kharab na hota aur gosht sadta na, aur agar Hawwa na hotin to koi aurat zamanay bhar apne shohar se khayanat na karti. (Muslim: 4/179). Baab: Jo safar se aaye wo apne ghar walon par dakhil honay mein jaldi na karay taake bikray baalon wali kanghi kar le. (Ulama ne kaha: Bani Israil par man o salwa naazil hua to unhein zakheera karnay se mana kiya gaya, unhon ne zakheera kiya to wo sad gaya; Hawwa ki khayanat se murad darakht khanay par uksana hai, zina nahi.)"
"847","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Ham Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saath aik ghazway mein thay. Phir jab ham wapas aaye to main apne sust raftaar oont par jaldi karnay laga. To mere peechay aik sawaar mujh se aa mila aur us ne apne paas mojood choti barchi se mere oont ko koch diya. To mera oont chalnay laga jaisa behtareen oont tum dekhtay ho. To main ne mur kar dekha to main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke saamnay tha. To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Jabir! Tumhein kya jaldi hai? Main ne kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool! Beshak main nai dulha hun. To Aap ne farmaya: Tum ne kunwari se shaadi ki ya bewah se? Unhon ne kaha: Main ne kaha: Balke bewah se. Aap ne farmaya: Kisi kunwari larki se kyun na ki jis se tum kheltay aur wo tum se khelti? Unhon ne kaha: Phir jab ham Madina pahunche to ham ne dakhil honay ka irada kiya. To Aap ne farmaya: Tehro yahan tak ke ham raat ko dakhil hon taake bikray baalon wali kanghi kar le aur wo aurat jis ka shohar ghair haazir tha (safai) kar le. Unhon ne kaha: Aur Aap ne farmaya: Jab tum (safar se) aao to aqalmandi ikhtiyar karo, aqalmandi ikhtiyar karo. (Muslim: 4/176). (Qatoof se murad sust raftaar hai; sha'sa wo aurat hai jis ke sar ke baal bikray hon; mugheeba wo aurat hai jis ka shohar chand din se ghair haazir ho; kais se murad aqal ka istemal hai.)"
